They see, hear, and hunt\u2014so stay out of sight, keep quiet, and don\u2019t let them catch you.\n\n\ud83e\udd1d WORK TOGETHER \ud83e\udd1d\nSurvival isn\u2019t easy alone. Communicate with your team, find safe hiding spots, and use your surroundings to stay one step ahead of the monsters. Will you escape together or be picked off one by one?", "short_description": "Monke Horror is a terrifying VR game where you and your friends explore an abandoned facility, trying to survive relentless monsters. These creatures stalk your every move, using sight and sound to hunt you down. Stay quiet, hide, and work together to escape before it\u2019s too late. Every shadow hides danger\u2014will you make it out alive, or will the monsters get you first?"}]}, "developer_name": "Banan Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://enderdragon0928.wixsite.com/monkephobia/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Banan Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://enderdragon0928.wixsite.com/monkephobia", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "7777782315678808"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "645234118302041"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "645234118302041"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1744